\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Validation at $h/R=1$. (a) Area along the descent against the exact catenoid area \textup  {\hbox {\mathsurround \z@ \normalfont  (\ignorespaces \ref  {eq:area}\unskip \@@italiccorr )}}. (b) All mesh vertices $(z_i,r_i)$ of the relaxed film against the catenary profile. (c) Neck radius along the flow: subcritical (blue) settles at the stable $c$; supercritical (orange, $h/R=1.5$) never stabilizes and crashes to the pinch-off detection threshold.}}{4}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
